e important  to each of them in sayaka's case being  her idol group and implying that they  were in imminent danger having been  greatly affected by this motive Sokka  immediately began devising a plan to  escape the killing game by plotting to  murder fellow student Leon quwata and  framing her middle school acquaintance  makoto for his death  ideally resulting in SIA cos victory  during the inevitable class trial and  you know all of this sounds wonderful in  theory but things didn't quite go to  plan and during her attempted murder of  Leon he turned the tables on Sokka  managing to stop her in the stomach and  leaving her to die in Makoto's bathroom  however with the last first-rank Sokka  managed to write Leon's name in blood  appearing as the number 1 1 0 3 7 and  following the class trial which found  Leon guilty of psychos murder  Kyoko Kyra Giri hypothesized that this  was psychos way of trying to make amends  to Makoto after attempting to frame him  for murder a theory that makoto would  take to heart as the number 1 1 0 3 7  would go on to be used as the password  for the abandoned hopes Peak Academy  building on Jabberwock island with  Makoto citing the reason for this  password being that it was the number  which a certain person had once left  behind in order to save him from trouble  some more fun facts about sock amazona  gone but not forgotten Sacco would make  an appearance in the anime series Donkin  room for three as a hallucination  conjured by Makoto along with the rest  of the deceased  70th class members and still not on  their psycho also appeared as an  illusion concert by Nagi took mida  during the super danganronpa 2.5 OVA  rather tragically it's implied  and Leon held a mutual attraction for  each other with Leon considering her to  be a pure-hearted girl and very much his  time the notion which Sayaka takes  attentive note of with a smile and a  blush on the flipside it can also be  theorized that this attraction is what  drove psychics target Leon in the first  place believing that he would be easier  to kill as a result the second idea is  something that has made much clearer in  the manga adaptation of trigger happy  havoc however it does need to be stated  that this is not canon and therefore  should not be taken as fact and one  stage younger sister of psycho was  planned to be included in ultra despair  goals similar to how many of the family  members of the other seventieth first  students had major roles in the game  however this idea was eventually  scrapped due to a being inconsistent  with psychos backstory as presented in  trigger happy havoc and finally a truly  useless fact about underwear during her  school years psychos undergarments of  choice wear pink panties accompanied by  a lacy bow but that pretty much does it  for Sayaka my zone if you enjoyed this  video and the content this channel  produced in general then please do  consider donating to the new world  review patreon because the support of  all of your amazing people is what  continues to make this channel possible  and if patreon isn't quite your style  then please do leave this video a like  share or subscribe because it also helps  support the channel and incredible  amount and if you'd like to join the fun  at any time and please do head over to  my disco server where a wide array of  shenanigan area takes place on a daily  basis and finally please do comment with  who what or where you'd like to see  featured in the next danganronpa 101  [Music]  [Music]

